HELP=<<END
Create a Git commit from stored objects and explicit metadata.
Returns the new commit ID. Does not update conversation files or gitlinks.
Signatures use Name <email> <unix-seconds> <+/-HHMM>.
@param tree Tree ID
@param parents Space-separated parent commit IDs; empty for a root commit
@param author Author signature including timestamp and timezone
@param committer Committer signature including timestamp and timezone
@param message Literal commit message
END
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash --worker1:@=worker.sh --help=$HELP
